cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use terco, please cite the paper below, which describes the GPU
  Hartree-Fock work several of its design decisions follow.
title: terco
abstract: >-
  Gaussian integrals on the GPU in standard Fortran: do concurrent for the
  parallelism, OpenACC only for device residency and the atomic updates the
  standard cannot express.
